/-
  A project's bundles (task 41714c0d, D50, D164): the history a push sends, one gzipped file per bundle, named by
  its level and the SHA-256 of its text. Reads are open; a push writes one and moves the branch head with it, and only
  compaction deletes one, into the trash (DataSafety.Spec).
-/
/-- `{"bundle": name, <field>: true or false}`, how the API reports a write. -/
def Worker.Bundles.report (name : Text) (field : Text) (value : Bool) (status : Int) : Js := json (Js.obj [("bundle", Js.text name), (field, Js.bool value)]) status